s/2025/03/image-419.webp","alt":"FAQ help and support icon","description":"","caption":"","name":"image-419","mime_type":"image/webp","type":"image","width":324,"height":356,"sizes":{"medium":"https://cms.six2eight.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/image-419-273x300.webp","medium-width":273,"medium-height":300,"large":"https://cms.six2eight.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/image-419.webp","large-width":324,"large-height":356}},"faq_left_title":"Clear answers to move forward confidently","button_text":"See FAQs","button_url":"/faq","block_title":"FAQs","faq_right_title":"Got Questions? Let’s Clear Things Up.","faq_items":[{"id":194,"title":"What UI/UX design services does six2eight provide?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe provide complete UX and UI design services for web, SaaS, and mobile products. This includes user research, wireframing, prototyping, usability testing, and polished UI design.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe also create scalable design systems that ensure consistency across products and platforms. Our goal is to deliver intuitive, conversion-driven designs that drive growth and engagement.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n"},{"id":735,"title":"How does six2eight approach user-centered design?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe follow a human-centered design process focused on real user needs and behaviors.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe conduct detailed user research, competitor analysis, and usability testing before making design decisions. We continuously gather user feedback and iterate on designs based on real-world interactions and outcomes. The result is an intuitive and accessible experience that aligns with user expectations and business objectives.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n"},{"id":195,"title":"What industries does six2eight specialize in?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eOur team has expertise across SaaS, fintech, healthcare, eCommerce, and enterprise platforms. We understand the unique challenges and user needs within each industry we serve.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe tailor every UX/UI solution to align with specific industry goals and audience expectations.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eOur work delivers digital experiences that feel seamless and deliver measurable business results.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n"},{"id":736,"title":"How does six2eight balance UI/UX design with technical development?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cp\u003eWe align design and development from the start through close collaboration between both teams. Our designers create interfaces with development feasibility and performance in mind from day one. Developers provide ongoing input during design phases to ensure seamless implementation and technical excellence. This process delivers visually beautiful, high-performing websites that meet both design and code standards. \u003c/p\u003e\n"},{"id":737,"title":"What is six2eight’s process for building high-performing websites?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eOur process starts with UX strategy, research, and wireframing based on user insights.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe then move to detailed UI design aligned with brand guidelines and usability best practices.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eOur development team builds the site with clean, optimized code for speed and SEO.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eFinally, we test extensively before launch to ensure flawless performance across all devices and browsers\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n"},{"id":738,"title":"How long does a typical website design and development project take?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eProject timelines typically range from 8 to 12 weeks, depending on project complexity and scope. We begin with in-depth discovery and research to align strategy with business and user goals. Our agile workflow allows flexibility while maintaining clear milestones and predictable delivery timelines. This ensures high-quality outcomes with realistic project schedules that meet client expectations.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n"},{"id":739,"title":"How does six2eight ensure quality during development?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe conduct thorough QA testing on all browsers, screen sizes, and device types before launch.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003ePerformance optimization, accessibility compliance, and cross-browser compatibility are key parts of our QA process. We also involve stakeholders in testing through user acceptance tests to validate functionality and usability. This ensures every product we deliver performs reliably and provides an exceptional user experience.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n"},{"id":740,"title":"Does six2eight provide post-launch optimization and support?","faq_descriptions":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eYes, we offer ongoing optimization, UX improvements, and support after the project launch.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe help monitor site performance using analytics and user behavior insights to guide improvements. Our team refines design elements and functionality based on evolving user needs and feedback. This approach keeps your website competitive, high-performing, and aligned with your business growth goals.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n"}]},{"type":"BlogsLayout","block_title":"Blogs","main_title":"Inside UI/UX Design \u0026 \u003cbr /\u003eWeb Development","items":[{"id":2989,"title":"What Are Primary Colors and How Do They Influence Design?","excerpt":"We design interfaces for a living, so this guide treats primary colors as a working tool, not a grade-school fact. It covers the three primary-color models and why red-yellow-blue is a useful myth. It also covers how digital color renders across devices, and how to use primary colors for hierarchy, brand, and accessibility. Key Takeaways ... \u003ca title=\"\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"\" aria-label=\"R